# ShorTul — Environment Variables

## Worker (set via `wrangler secret put` or in wrangler.toml `[vars]`)

| Variable | Required | Description |
|----------|----------|-------------|
| `SUPABASE_URL` | Yes | Supabase project URL |
| `SUPABASE_ANON_KEY` | Yes | Supabase anon/public key |
| `SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY` | Yes (secret) | Server-only key — **NEVER expose to browser** |
| `ADMIN_SECRET` | Yes (secret) | Admin API authentication token |
| `SITE_URL` | Yes | Canonical site URL (e.g. https://shortul.app) |
| `ORIGIN_URL` | No | Next.js Pages URL for reserved route fallback |

## Dashboard (Next.js — `.env.local`)

| Variable | Required | Description |
|----------|----------|-------------|
| `NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL` | Yes | Supabase project URL (public) |
| `NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY` | Yes | Supabase anon key (public) |
| `NEXT_PUBLIC_WORKER_URL` | Yes | Cloudflare Worker URL for API calls |

> **Security:** `SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY` and `ADMIN_SECRET` are NEVER exposed to the browser. They exist only in the Worker environment.
